# ==============================
# 📋 OPERACIONES CRUD
# ==============================

### Obtener todos los documentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###

### Obtener documento por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/sales/{{saleFA_RI_21.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###

### Confirmar documento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/sales/{{saleFA_RI_21.response.body.id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###

### Cancelar documento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/sales/{{saleFA_RI_21.response.body.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###

### Eliminar documento (solo borradores)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/sales/{{saleFA_RI_21.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
x-tenant: dev

###
